  "description": "The NextLevel data-warehouse channel in one package: a producer side that turns any object into a warehouse row and sends it, and a consumer side that writes those rows into ClickHouse tables that create and grow themselves. Domain-agnostic: tenancy and any other stamped field are parameters, not built in. Unifies NextLevel.DWH.Producer and NextLevel.DWH.Consumer.",
